 {server}←ServerLoop server;msg;⎕TRAP
⍝ ⍵ ←→ a Server space. Changed according to my needs: Kai2#
⍝ ⎕TRAP must be localized for "C" (cut back) to work
 :If 0<⎕NC'#.ErrorParms.signal'
     ⎕TRAP←⊂#.ErrorParms.signal'C' '→∆CarryOn'
 :EndIf
 ⎕TNAME←'Rumba Server Loop'
 {}{¯1≡ServerWait ⍵:0 ⋄ ∇ ⍵}server
 {}server LogRumba'Server stopped: the Conga server object has gone'
 :Return

∆CarryOn:
 server ErrorInRumba ⍬
⍝Done
